From: TDVP Device Team <devices@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] generated libtool: do not inject runtime library directories

The package delivers target libraries to the standard loader directories.
Compile-time paths remain in linker arguments; they must not be embedded
as runtime paths when referencing the uninstalled sibling liblber.

--- a/libtool
+++ b/libtool
@@ -247,1 +247,1 @@
-runpath_var=LD_RUN_PATH
+runpath_var=
@@ -382,1 +382,1 @@
-hardcode_libdir_flag_spec="\$wl-rpath \$wl\$libdir"
+hardcode_libdir_flag_spec=""
